{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is visible, then move, grab, check properties, do task; else scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    />\"",
